# The reach markers of the work-area overlay: with Work areas on and the Stonecutter button pressed, each node where a
# stonecutter's hut fits shows a green disc where a stone heap lies in reach and a red ring where none does.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh reach-markers --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10
# The castle's click places it at 24,13. The heaps at 24,15 and 26,17 lie in reach of the sites south of it; none lies in
# reach of the sites around 24,9.
click-tile 24 13
wait 0.3
expect-at 24 13 building
expect-at 24 15 object
expect-at 26 17 object
button Work areas
button Stonecutter
wait 0.3
shot near 25 16 3 2
shot far 24 9 3 2

# Build help draws its markers under the reach markers; both show.
button Build help
wait 0.3
shot with-build-help 24 9 3 2

# The Stonecutter button released: no reach marker.
button Stonecutter
wait 0.3
shot released 24 9 3 2
